Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.49,2:01:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧 我也硬邦邦啊
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.56,2:01:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 公公
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.26,2:01:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.04,2:01:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.17,2:02:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好硬
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.64,2:02:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舒服吧\N舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.19,2:02:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,媳妇儿 好好儿看着我哦
